# console-fixture — the G57 debug-surface fixture (PLAN-WASM-2 W4): the
# whole program + phrase as ONE submission (the DEC-19 run model), so every
# engine span anchors into the exact buffer the editor holds (I-9) and the
# browser's debug panel can be compared field-for-field against the native
# dump (G57). One line = one submission (the session-script convention);
# definitions first, the phrase last.
: no-sevens ( i64 -- i64 bool ) dup 7 == not ; : add-safely ( i64 -- i64 ) needs [ no-sevens ] 1 + ; : wrap ( i64 -- i64 ) add-safely ; : double ( i64 -- i64 ) dup + ; 7 wrap drop 2 double
